        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The moment she's out of the cavern, a chill sets in."
    },
    {
        "text": "But it merely spurs on her heart to run faster."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#2$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "How... How do I face her?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "She cannot word it. She cannot face it."
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Tut tut tut. Whatever will you do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_openftstpwalk",
        "volume": 1,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "o"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "o",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Sakiko does not need to turn her head to know who it is."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#18$1",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$mist_intro",
        "key": "$mist_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#18$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now this girl's dreamland, I'm rather satisfied with!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sweet dreams for every child are the duty of the Castle of Dreams, and I've granted each one of her wishes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "text": "Honestly, I'm surprised how smoothly this dream runs\u2014no, flawlessly, in fact. Beyond my wildest expectations.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, things have gotten even more interesting now, you know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...You're deceiving her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#20$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, no, no, nothing of the sort. We've had plenty of dealings, she and I. She knows full well what I am.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, seeing these results just fills my heart with joy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "text": "She knows it's all a dream and she still doesn't want to leave! Isn't that the very proof my dreamspinning is unmatched?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1937_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_yingying_ked_1",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Chirping in agreement)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Corettons"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#14$3",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#18$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, you coming here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now that's interesting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, I'll leave you two to it, then! I trust you'll soon discover just how amusing this dream really is, Sakiko Togawa.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_shdwblwvr",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#14$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sakiko. Everyone's waiting for you. Let's go back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go back?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "text": "Morpheus just vanished in front of you. Aren't you the least bit surprised...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#14$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everything here, we imagined together.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "'We'?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#14$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You... aren't a part of us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
