    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1939_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You play guitar so well, Mutsumi-chan!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi's Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#13$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Saki...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#16$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No. Mum... Where did Saki go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1939_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Saki-chan? Maybe she just went off somewhere...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi's Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#6$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, no. Saki... Saki would never abandon me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The cheering crowd suddenly goes deathly quiet. They all stare straight at Mutsumi."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1939_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mutsumi-chan, you seem to have forgotten\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi's Mother"
    },
    {
        "text": "This isn't just your dream.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi's Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1939_1#1$1",
        "focus": "all"
    },
